          "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: exact four-view reconstruction reference for a local Hunyuan3D environmental mesh. Design ONE massive ruined foundry shrine for a dark volcanic Chinese-fantasy roguelike FPS. A squat tall charcoal basalt brick furnace set into a rugged connected plinth, broad tapering upper exhaust stack with a jagged broken rim, front shallow vaulted ash-filled firebox recess (dark interior without actual fire or emission), thick weathered bronze structural bands and large rivet heads wrapping the furnace, one attached broad side buttress and a few attached clinker chunks at its foot. Strong three-dimensional rounded-square volume, approximately 4.6 m wide,4.8 m tall,3.4 m deep. Old warm copper contrasts with cool matte black-purple stone and rusty red staining, carefully sculpted chipped edges, restrained ancient carved motifs, dark ash around front recess. No skinny hanging chains, disconnected tools, separate objects, huge spikes, active flames, smoke, lava, ground plane or landscape. High-quality stylized game PBR asset with bold readable masses and medium sculpted detail, material surfaces not noisy or plastic. Compose a wide reference sheet with four isolated renders of THE SAME foundry in one row ordered FRONT,LEFT,BACK,RIGHT. Strict orthographic level views, no three-quarter camera and no perspective. Equal physical scale and identical ground baseline with ample white gutters; all silhouettes fully visible. Side views explicitly show the furnace depth and wrapping copper bands; back is closed masonry with the same upper stack shape. Neutral soft diffuse studio lighting, minimal shadows on plain pure white background. No text, view labels, humans or magical VFX. Every view must agree on all geometry and band placement.",
